  "title": "Barbara L Possible NDE 6250",
  "date": "1965",
  "content": "It's simple and I guess that is what bothers me because as much as I read it is usually much more dramatic. I know it happened and can still see the man next to my bed in my mind, but I don't know him. I was very ill and in the critical care unit. I was in the hospital about 10 days after an exploratory surgery. They thought it was gall bladder disease prior to the surgery but because of my age and because of a severe back up of bile the doctors could not be certain. It was in fact a diseased gall bladder, which was removed. I was young, lacked much confidence and didn't ask questions. I was in severe pain and fell asleep. I became aware of a man in a grey suit standing next to my bed. He was tall, slim and older. It was not frightening in any way. He very simply said, 'you can come with me now or you can stay'. I knew he meant that I would die if I went with him. It was whatever I chose. I said very quickly, 'I still have a son in diapers I have to stay'. With no time passing whatsoever, I was back in my body and in extreme pain. In my experience, there was no dramatic white light, no angels, and no one who had passed on. It was simple. That is the end of the story. I got well in a normal fashion. Yes, of course I have had many 'hard to explain' experiences before and since, but that is all 'normal' if people are paying attention.",
